{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/405409-new-witch-finders-mystery-vitality","id":405409,"title":"New Witch Finders Mystery - \"Vitality\"","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-02-13T20:11:24-08:00","id":405409,"title":"New Witch Finders Mystery - \"Vitality\"","content":"Was working on something for a character, decided to throw it up here to see what everyone thinks. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <b>Vitality - Tier 2</b><br /> <br /> <i>Presence</i><br /> <br /> Source: When a witch provides first aid or medical help to an individual party or person for an entire week, she gains Source.<br /> <br /> The Mystery of Vitality is derived from the Mystery of Health, albeit tailored to have a more combat-oriented bent. Users of Vitality have often been described as &quot;godly&quot; or &quot;god-like&quot;, gifted by battle-governing deities to aid troops in their darkest hours with gifts of strength and health. Indeed, it is often said that Vitality's wielders have a peculiar &quot;glow&quot;, seeming healthier of skin and brighter of eye in even the sickest conditions.<br /> <br /> <br /> Revitalize (Instant): Targets oneself, and can be used once per scene. So long as the target stands still, they regain 1 health level per turn for turns = Gnosis. starting with the rightmost box. If one or more health boxes completely returns to normal, gain a point of Source.<br /> <br /> Shield of the Weak (Instant): Targets oneself or another with an expenditure of WP. For the rest of the scene, whenever the target is hit with a missile attack, the damage of the attack is halved, rounding down if needed. If at least one target takes no damage during the scene as a result, gain a point of Source.<br /> <br /> Strengthen the Body (Instant): Costs 1 source, and targets oneself or targets = Gnosis. For the rest of the scene, all of the target's/targets' movement dice (running, jumping, climbing, sitting, etc.) dice have extra dice equivalent to half the number of dots (rounded down) a Witch has in a stat corresponding to the one used in the roll. For example, a Witch with a 3 in Sta would give +1 to any movement rolls involving Sta, such as long-distance running.<br /> <br /> Regeneration (Instant, Extended): Costs 1 source, and targets oneself or targets = Gnosis. On a dramatic failure, targets lose 1 level of health, starting from the leftmost, starting from the leftmost, per turn for the rest of the scene. On a failure, nothing happens. On a success, targets regen 1 level of health, starting from the rightmost, per turn for the rest of the scene. Exceptional allows the Witch to extend the effect to the next scene without re-rolling.<br /> <br /> Wrath of the Heavens (Instant, Resisted): Costs 1 source and 1 WP, and targets everyone in a scene; can be used once per story. At the expense of the entire Witch's healthbox being downgraded by one level, anyone she considers friendly has their entire healthbox upgraded by one, and her enemies downgraded by one. If the Witch downgrades her healthbox by two levels, her allies' can go up by two instead. Enemies resist with Stamina+Composure+Gnosis.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":1874,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","user":"Sikla Alkis","date":". 02-13-2015, 11:16 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}